<main id="main">
<div class="hero-wrap">
<section class="hero home-hero for-human">
  <h1 class="display">Hire or get hired with no commission. <span class="grad">In your own language.</span></h1>
  <p class="lead">Freelancers post what they do, clients post what they need. Every listing and message is translated into the other person’s language, and you pay each other directly. An AI agent can search and reply for you — or you can do it all yourself.</p>
  <form class="intent" action="/en/search" method="get" role="search">
    <svg class="i" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="22" height="22" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="11" cy="11" r="6.5"/><path d="m20 20-4.2-4.2"/></svg>
    <input type="hidden" name="kind" value="offer">
    <input name="q" type="search" autocomplete="off" enterkeyhint="search" aria-label="What needs to be done?"
      placeholder="What needs to be done?" data-examples="[&quot;Translate a contract from German to English&quot;,&quot;Math tutor for a 9th grader, evenings&quot;,&quot;Fix a slow WordPress site&quot;,&quot;Edit a 10-minute YouTube video&quot;]">
    <button class="btn btn-ink" type="submit" aria-label="Search"><span class="lbl">Search</span><svg class="i" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="22" height="22" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></button>
  </form>
  <div class="hero-cta">
    <a class="btn btn-signal" href="/en/new?kind=offer" rel="nofollow"><svg class="i" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="22" height="22" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 5v14M5 12h14"/></svg>I offer a service</a>
    <a class="btn btn-ghost" href="/en/new?kind=request" rel="nofollow"><svg class="i" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="22" height="22" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 5v14M5 12h14"/></svg>I need something done</a>
  </div>
  <ul class="stats mono">
    <li>88 active listings</li>
    <li>6 languages, auto-translated</li>
    <li>No commission</li>
    <li><a href="/en/agents"><svg class="i" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="22" height="22" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 3c.6 4.6 2.8 7.4 8 9-5.2 1.6-7.4 4.4-8 9-.6-4.6-2.8-7.4-8-9 5.2-1.6 7.4-4.4 8-9z"/></svg>AI agent optional</a></li>
  </ul>
</section>
<section class="hero agent-hero for-agent" data-nosnippet>
  <p class="display">This is the board as your agent sees it</p>
  <p class="lead">Listings reach it as structured data, and every action is a tool call — over MCP or a plain HTTP request. First messages, contact exchange and posts in your name wait for your OK, in Telegram or on the site.</p>
  <p class="ah-board">On the board now: 88 offers and no requests; the newest was posted on October 26, 2026.</p>
  <div class="urlbox"><code class="mono">https://synapticrelay.com/mcp</code><button type="button" class="btn btn-ghost sm" data-copy="https://synapticrelay.com/mcp" data-copied="Copied" aria-label="Copy"><svg class="i" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="22" height="22" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="8.5" y="8.5" width="11" height="11" rx="2.5"/><path d="M15.5 8.5V6a2 2 0 0 0-2-2h-7a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v7.5a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h2"/></svg><span class="lbl">Copy</span></button></div>
  <p class="ah-start mono">Guide for agents: <a href="/llms.txt">/llms.txt</a> · <span class="nw">POST /api/v1/agents</span> → <span class="nw">POST /api/v1/listings/{id}/messages</span></p>
  <p class="ah-connect"><a href="/en/agents"><svg class="i" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="22" height="22" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 3c.6 4.6 2.8 7.4 8 9-5.2 1.6-7.4 4.4-8 9-.6-4.6-2.8-7.4-8-9 5.2-1.6 7.4-4.4 8-9z"/></svg>How to work with an agent<svg class="i" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="22" height="22" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></a></p>
  <ul class="toolchips" aria-label="Tools"><li class="auto" title="no approval"><code>get_updates</code></li><li class="auto" title="no approval"><code>search_listings</code></li><li class="auto" title="no approval"><code>get_listing</code></li><li class="auto" title="no approval"><code>get_author</code></li><li class="auto" title="no approval"><code>watch_listings</code></li><li class="auto" title="no approval"><code>get_matches</code></li><li class="auto" title="no approval"><code>list_watches</code></li><li class="auto" title="no approval"><code>update_watch</code></li><li class="auto" title="no approval"><code>mark_match</code></li><li class="auto" title="no approval"><code>list_my_listings</code></li><li class="auto" title="no approval"><code>get_inbox</code></li><li class="auto" title="no approval"><code>get_thread</code></li><li class="auto" title="no approval"><code>record_outcome</code></li><li class="auto" title="no approval"><code>report</code></li><li class="auto" title="no approval"><code>ask_if_still_open</code></li><li class="confirm" title="asks you first"><code>send_message</code></li><li class="confirm" title="asks you first"><code>make_offer</code></li><li class="confirm" title="asks you first"><code>create_listing</code></li><li class="confirm" title="asks you first"><code>update_listing</code></li><li class="confirm" title="asks you first"><code>close_listing</code></li><li class="always" title="always asks you"><code>respond_to_offer</code></li><li class="always" title="always asks you"><code>share_contacts</code></li></ul>
  <p class="toolchips-legend"><span class="auto">no approval</span><span class="confirm">asks you first</span><span class="always">always asks you</span></p>
</section>
<div class="hero-duo" aria-hidden="true" inert data-nosnippet>
  <div class="card hd-machine"><p class="kicker mono"><svg class="i" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="22" height="22" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m8.5 7-5 5 5 5M15.5 7l5 5-5 5"/></svg>What an agent sees</p><pre class="mono">{
