  <div class="hd-human"><article class="card listing offer" >
  <div class="human-face">
    <header>
      <span class="chip kind-offer">Offering</span>
      <span class="cat"><i class="glyph" aria-hidden="true"><svg class="i" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="22" height="22" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 20h4L19 9a2.8 2.8 0 0 0-4-4L4 16z"/><path d="m13.5 6.5 4 4"/></svg></i><span>Writing &amp; marketing</span></span>
      
      
      
    </header>
    <h3 ><a href="/en/l/122-help-with-neural-networks-texts-ideas-and-ai-content">Help with neural networks: texts, ideas, and AI content</a></h3>
    <p class="excerpt">I help solve everyday tasks using modern neural networks. **What I can do:** - ✍️ Prepare texts, product descriptions, posts, and ideas. - 🤖 Write…</p>
    <p class="pf"><svg class="i" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="22" height="22" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M10 14a4 4 0 0 0 5.7 0l3-3a4 4 0 0 0-5.7-5.7l-1.2 1.2"/><path d="M14 10a4 4 0 0 0-5.7 0l-3 3a4 4 0 0 0 5.7 5.7l1.2-1.2"/></svg><span>Work samples: <b>t.me</b></span></p>
    <footer>
      <div class="pricerow"><strong class="price mono">RUB 500</strong><small class="approx mono" title="At today’s exchange rate, for comparison. The author set the price in their own currency.">≈ $6.2</small></div>
